    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colleran Auctioneers are pleased to be favoured with the sale of this attractive four bedroom, end of terrace house, fronting onto a large green area. This modern, bright, spacious home is in turnkey condition and ready for immediate occupancy. \n\nBuilt by O`Malley`s in approximately 2003, this house enjoys all the benefits of modern construction and design. The spacious living accommodation is spread over three floors with two of the bedrooms having their own ensuites. This property would make an excellent home due to its spacious living accommodation & easy access to so many amenities and Galway City centre\n\nIf you are looking for a modern bright, spacious house with every necessary amenity on your doorstep, we challenge you to find a better value in this very popular seaside village.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 6.3m (20'8\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nWith guest toilet and wash hand basin. Additional storage under stairs.\n\nSitting Room - 5.1m (16'9\") x 3.7m (12'2\")\nWith feature marble fireplace. Recessed lighting and decorative coving to ceiling.\n\nKitchen/dining Area - 5.9m (19'4\") x 5.2m (17'1\")\nHas a very generous range of built in and overhead units with integrated oven, hob, extractor, fridge freezer and dishwasher. Double French doors to back garden.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 4m (13'1\") x 3.1m (10'2\")\nWith built in wardrobe. Ensuite 1.8m x 1.6 with shower, toilet, wash hand basin, fully tiled.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m (9'10\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.4m (14'5\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.6m (8'6\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nWith bath, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nSecond Floor\n\nMain Bedroom - 4m (13'1\") x 4m (13'1\")\nWith four door built in wardrobe. Ensuite 3m x 1.7m with toilet, shower and wash hand basin. Fully tiled.\n\nHome Office - 3.1m (10'2\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\n\nGarden\nThere is a private walled back garden.\n\nHeating\nOil fired.\n\nArea\nApproximately 162.95 sqm / 1,753.97sq ft\n\nManagement Fee\n1,100.00 per annum\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Modern four bedroom property in the heart of Barna Village. </li><li> Fronting on to a large landscaped green area. </li><li> Bright, spacious accommodation spread over three floors. </li><li> Excellent home due to its unrivalled location in Barna Village.</li></ul>"
      },
